generation-inference/issues/3304#issuecomment-3153989051", "excerpt": "Here are the steps to reproduce the issue : \n\n```\n docker run --rm -it --gpus=1 --shm-size=1g -v \"/home/jyce/unmute.mcp/volumes/llm-tgi/engines:/engines\" -v \"/home/jyce/unmute.mcp/volumes/llm-tgi/models:/models\"  huggingface/optimum-nvidia\n:v0.1.0b9-py310 bash\n```\n\nThen in the container : \n```\nroot@1959885e2183:/opt/optimum-nvidia/examples# cd /models/\nroot@1959885e2183:/models# git clone https://", "login": "psykokwak-com"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3304#issuecomment-3298606066", "excerpt": "Hi, any updates?", "login": "MohannadEhabBarakat"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3304#issuecomment-3370813690", "excerpt": "\n\n> The error suggests it cannot find a JSON file, but the config.json file is present in the engine directory:\n\n@MohannadEhabBarakat TGI also expects the `generation_config.json` file. After `trtllm-build`, copy the original `generation_config.json` to the same directory as the resulting `config.json` file.\n\nThe error message could be made clearer by https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation", "login": "leejuyuu"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3304#issuecomment-3153989051"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:41:40.925867Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
