orting model to neuron with config: {''batch_size'': 4, ''sequence_length'': 4096, ''num_cores'': 2, ''auto_cast_type'': ''bfloat16''}.\n```", "login": "jimburtoft"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3299"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:41:40.927274Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
