 "Hey @MohannadEhabBarakat thanks for opening the issue! Indeed the changed I pushed there were only related to `sccache` and not to TensorRT per se, meaning that the best people to ping around the topic would be either @Hugoch or @Narsil at the moment since they have relevant contributions to it 🤗 ", "login": "alvarobartt"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3296#issuecomment-3121964382", "excerpt": "Also have the issue :(\nFixed by downgrading to \n`ghcr.io/huggingface/text-generation-inference:3.3.4-trtllm`", "login": "psykokwak-com"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3296#issuecomment-3298610699", "excerpt": "Hi @Hugoch and @Narsil \nDo you think trtllm will be supported? \n\nThanks a lot for the great project ", "login": "MohannadEhabBarakat"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/huggingface/text-generation-inference/issues/3296"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:41:40.927686Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
