m.  It doesn''t seem to matter what size dataset I use...", "login": "umm-maybe"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/237#issuecomment-1264150554", "excerpt": "> Is the error you are getting something like this: \"jaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED: Failed to allocate request for 32.00MiB (33554432B) on device ordinal 0: while running replica 0 and partition 0 of a replicated computation (other replicas may have failed as well).\" If so, I have the same problem. It doesn''t seem to matter what size dataset I use...\r\n\r\nNo. I get a depen", "login": "zzj0402"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/237#issuecomment-1237660250"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:44:46.958422Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO credibility_r2.credibility_findings (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id, dimension_id, severity, payload) VALUES ('paper_018_openreview_2024_02_11_credibility@81afd239083f6f41', 'ca-1cb7adeb2a905fae', 'f-signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-202', 'code_reproduction_signals', 'info', '{"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-202", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-202", "repository_id": "repo-5f84e24dca3f", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1050523437", "source_title": "TpuEmbeddingEngine_WriteParameters not available in this library.", "source_excerpt": "Here''s a full set of commands to reproduce the error:\r\n(The GPT-J-6B/step_383500 weights are already uploaded to gcloud)\r\n\r\n`gcloud alpha compute tpus tpu-vm create my_tpu_vm --zone=us-central1-a --accelerator-type=v3-8 --version=v2-alpha`\r\n`gcloud alpha compute tpus tpu-vm ssh my_tpu_vm --zone us-central1-a  --project [MY PROJECT ID]`\r\n`$ git clone https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-j", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "closed", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:44:58.131862Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1048828052", "excerpt": "check jax version ig you are using 0.2.16 but the correct version in order to run the training is 0.2.12", "login": "whoislimshady"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1048903740", "excerpt": "If I run `pip3 list | grep jax`, it returns:\r\n```\r\njax                          0.2.12\r\njaxlib                       0.3.0\r\n```\r\n", "login": "nikhilanayak"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1049035971", "excerpt": "Also @whoislimshady when I run it, it crashes and prints out\r\n```\r\n2022-02-23 17:35:25.749201: F external/org_tensorflow/tensorflow/core/tpu/tpu_library_init_fns.inc:104] TpuEmbeddingEngine_WriteParameters not available in this library.\r\nAborted (core dumped)\r\n```", "login": "nikhilanayak"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1049716790", "excerpt": "jax 0.2.12 won''t run and crashes with this error. Using\r\n```\r\npip install \"jax[tpu]>=0.2.16\" -f https://storage.googleapis.com/jax-releases/libtpu_releases.html\r\n```\r\nworks but introduces new issues.", "login": "mrseeker"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1049963894", "excerpt": "@nikhilanayak i also faced the same issue but somehow it got resolved by just changing version from 0.2.16 to 12\r\ni am sharing the packages i have on my env and i am able to train model \r\nhope this helps \r\n`absl-py==0.12.0\r\naiohttp==3.8.1\r\naiohttp-cors==0.7.0\r\naioredis==2.0.1\r\naiosignal==1.2.0\r\nanyio==3.5.0\r\nappdirs==1.4.4\r\nasgiref==3.5.0\r\nastunparse==1.6.3\r\nasync-timeout==4.0.2\r\nattrs==19.3.0\r\nAu", "login": "whoislimshady"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1049977881", "excerpt": "@whoislimshady It looks like you are using torch 1.8.1? I got 1.11.1...", "login": "mrseeker"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1049997298", "excerpt": "Just to be sure that everyone is on the correct page: What version of TPU-VM are you actually running? It might be that the version that people are running is actually incorrect, and that a lower version actually performs better than the newer ones. I am running with `--version tpu-vm-tf-2.8.0`, but I think this version might need be actually a lower one (2.6.3)", "login": "mrseeker"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1050238507", "excerpt": "For fine tuning I have always used tpu version `v2-alpha`. Havent come across any errors so far.", "login": "safeeazeem"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1050523437", "excerpt": "Here''s a full set of commands to reproduce the error:\r\n(The GPT-J-6B/step_383500 weights are already uploaded to gcloud)\r\n\r\n`gcloud alpha compute tpus tpu-vm create my_tpu_vm --zone=us-central1-a --accelerator-type=v3-8 --version=v2-alpha`\r\n`gcloud alpha compute tpus tpu-vm ssh my_tpu_vm --zone us-central1-a  --project [MY PROJECT ID]`\r\n`$ git clone https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-j", "login": "nikhilanayak"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1050887576", "excerpt": "Okay, I fixed the issue this way:\r\n- Use version v2-alpha instead of the  tpu-vm-tf-2.8.0\r\n- Install the package \"python3-venv\"\r\n- Build & start a virtualenv environment (`python3 -m venv venv` and `source venv/bin/activate`)\r\n- Install wheel (needed for some)\r\n- Install the requirements\r\n- Install Jax (as told by Google: `pip install \"jax[tpu]>=0.2.16\" -f https://storage.googleapis.com/jax-releas", "login": "mrseeker"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1052429788", "excerpt": "@mrseeker Your solution fixed my problem too. Thank you for sharing it!", "login": "mosmos6"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/202#issuecomment-1050523437"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:44:58.131862Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO credibility_r2.credibility_findings (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id, dimension_id, severity, payload) VALUES ('paper_018_openreview_2024_02_11_credibility@81afd239083f6f41', 'ca-1cb7adeb2a905fae', 'f-signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-184', 'code_reproduction_signals', 'info', '{"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-184", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-5f84e24dca3f-184", "repository_id": "repo-5f84e24dca3f", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/184", "source_title": "HF model does not work on Torch/XLA", "source_excerpt": "HF model does not work on Torch/XLA\n**Disclaimer:** This isn''t a high-priority issue, it is a bit of a weird and unusual use case. Mostly a PSA in case anyone else runs into the same issue. \r\n\r\nThe HF version of the GPT-J model does not load using Torch/XLA. \r\n\r\nError:\r\n```\r\nRuntimeError: torch_xla/csrc/tensor_methods.cpp:896 : Check failed: xla::ShapeUtil::Compatible(shapes.back(), tensor_shape) ", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "closed", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:45:01.807290Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/184#issuecomment-1023964307", "excerpt": "I would suggest filing an issue on the huggingface or pytorch repo, as this does not involve any code from this repository", "login": "kingoflolz"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/kingoflolz/mesh-transformer-jax/issues/184"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:45:01.807290Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
