rg/torchcodec/main/generated_examples/migration/torchvision_migration.html)). \n\nI''ll close this as we won", "login": "NicolasHug"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/pytorch/vision/issues/9699"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:54:26.655887Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO credibility_r2.credibility_findings (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id, dimension_id, severity, payload) VALUES ('paper_043_iclr_2026_proceedings_credibility@a33e49d02fb6ac68', 'ca-f3ed18574132308a', 'f-signal-repo-d8145bb67a00-9687', 'code_reproduction_signals', 'info', '{"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-d8145bb67a00-9687", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-d8145bb67a00-9687", "repository_id": "repo-d8145bb67a00", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/vision/issues/9687", "source_title": "Use a safe extraction filter for dataset tar archives", "source_excerpt": "Use a safe extraction filter for dataset tar archives\n> **AI-assisted issue conversion (Codex).** Original report and reproduction by @0xSaud; all credit belongs to the original reporter.\n>\n> Source: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/security/advisories/GHSA-m4rq-h4j7-8887\n>\n> The reporter identifies `_extract_tar()` calling `tar.extractall(to_path)` without an explicit extraction filter. On Pyth", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "closed", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:54:27.163794Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/vision/issues/9687#issuecomment-5982083159", "excerpt": "I reproduced the tar path traversal and opened #9693 with a fix. It uses the stdlib data filter where available, adds path/link validation around it, and keeps older supported Python versions safe with a validated extraction fallback. Tests cover ../ entries, absolute paths, and outside-pointing symlinks; focused standalone checks pass. Full repository pytest is running in upstream CI because this", "login": "lindicaphxag-tech"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/pytorch/vision/issues/9687"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:54:27.163794Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
