rtainty and Partial Information", "authors": ["Zhou"], "year": 2013, "years": [2013], "doi": "10.21236/ada591355", "source_url": "https://doi.org/10.21236/ada591355", "title_similarity": 0.509090909090909}, {"candidate_id": "candidate-3", "title": "Decision Making under Partial Information: Theory and Algorithms", "authors": ["Insua"], "year": 1990, "years": [1990], "doi": "10.1007/978-3-642-51656-6_2", "source_url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-51656-6_2", "title_similarity": 0.4785276073619632}, {"candidate_id": "candidate-4", "title": "Decision Analysis under Partial Information", "authors": ["Podinovski", "Podinovski"], "year": 1998, "years": [1998], "doi": "10.1007/978-3-642-45772-2_7", "source_url": "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-45772-2_7", "title_similarity": 0.5454545454545454}], "conflicting_fields": [], "selected_candidate_id": null, "match_confidence": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:22.978615Z", "response_sha256": "40a3b551312007fd0fedefa4cfc38b335919478871c9b7e2c6f64f64e4a29856", "from_cache": false}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://api.crossref.org/works?query.bibliographic=Landscape+surrogate%3A+Learning+decision+losses+for+mathematical+optimization+under+partial+information&rows=5"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:22.980083Z", "uncertainty": "未核实、解析失败或 API 失败均不能作为引用虚假的结论。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO credibility_r2.credibility_findings (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id, dimension_id, severity, payload) VALUES ('paper_049_iclr_2025_proceedings_credibility@d5c17c16810f1773', 'ca-95cd4cb6153fcda4', 'f-signal-repo-87195fa93041-18', 'code_reproduction_signals', 'info', '{"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-87195fa93041-18", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-87195fa93041-18", "repository_id": "repo-87195fa93041", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18", "source_title": "tensorflow.python.framework.errors_impl.InternalError: Blas GEMM launch failed", "source_excerpt": "tensorflow.python.framework.errors_impl.InternalError: Blas GEMM launch failed\nHello, \r\n  Thanks for your great work. I am currently trying to reproduce it and stuck with some problems about tensorflow. I have successfully generated training dataset for setcover and meet the following Error when I run the ` python 03_train_gcnn.py setcover -m baseline`:\r\n```\r\n[2023-02-04 16:21:35.606917] EPOCH 0..", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "open", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:26.873873Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18#issuecomment-1484587600", "excerpt": "Hi, I met the same issue. Have you solved it? If you have any solution, please tell me. Thanks!", "login": "Root970103"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18#issuecomment-2071848634", "excerpt": "@liebenxj Hello! I heard that you successfully obtained a training sample by running 02_generate_dataset.py, could you please provide me with a setcover training sample data? I failed to run it successfully, but I want to observe the data in the samples, thank you!", "login": "TengfeiHou-rgb"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18#issuecomment-2104153639", "excerpt": "@liebenxj hello!  I heard that you successfully obtained a training sample by running 02_generate_dataset.py, could you please help me to solve these two problem? \r\n1. File \"02_generate_dataset.py\", line 37, in branchexeclp\r\n    utilities.extract_khalil_variable_features(self.model, [], self.khalil_root_buffer)\r\n  File \"/home/fengruixiang/2024_04/learn2branch/utilities.py\", line 305, in extract_kh", "login": "Frx12138"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18#issuecomment-2512063359", "excerpt": "It seems a bug of RTX!\r\nI tried to solve it by installing 4 patches for cuda-9, downloading from [patch_link](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-90-download-archive?target_os=Linux&target_arch=x86_64&target_distro=Ubuntu&target_version=1604&target_type=runfilelocal) with the following commands:\r\n\r\n1. chmod +x cuda_9.0.176.1_linux.run\r\n2.   chmod +x cuda_9.0.176.2_linux.run\r\n3.   chmod +x cuda_9.0.1", "login": "zhengzetao"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18#issuecomment-2512083428", "excerpt": "> @liebenxj hello! I heard that you successfully obtained a training sample by running 02_generate_dataset.py, could you please help me to solve these two problem?\r\n> \r\n> 1. File \"02_generate_dataset.py\", line 37, in branchexeclp\r\n>    utilities.extract_khalil_variable_features(self.model, [], self.khalil_root_buffer)\r\n>    File \"/home/fengruixiang/2024_04/learn2branch/utilities.py\", line 305, in ", "login": "zhengzetao"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/ds4dm/learn2branch/issues/18"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:26.873873Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id, finding_id) DO NOTHING;
