 have already tried.\n\n### System information\n- OS Platform and Distribution (e.g., Linux Ubuntu 16.04): macos 26\n- Flax, jax, jaxlib versions (obtain with `pip show ", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "closed", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:49.298535Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5596#issuecomment-5779979577", "excerpt": "This should be fixed by #5580 when that gets merged. ", "login": "samanklesaria"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5596#issuecomment-5830199593", "excerpt": "Solved in the latest version. Thank you :)", "login": "JulienRaynal"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5596"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:49.298535Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}, {"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-4fa7295fba68-5591", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-4fa7295fba68-5591", "repository_id": "repo-4fa7295fba68", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5591", "source_title": "NNX MultiHeadAttention: is_causal=True during decode attends only to key position 0", "source_excerpt": "NNX MultiHeadAttention: is_causal=True during decode attends only to key position 0\n## `is_causal=True` during NNX decode attends only to key position 0\r\n\r\n`nnx.MultiHeadAttention` documents `is_causal` as the way to overlay a causal mask, and decode already installs a cache-occupancy mask (`arange(max_length) <= cur_index`) so a single query can attend to every written KV slot.\r\n\