ething that is comparable with ints.", "login": "samanklesaria"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5571"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:50.732653Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}, {"finding_id": "f-signal-repo-4fa7295fba68-5512", "dimension_id": "code_reproduction_signals", "severity": "info", "status": "pending_verification", "title": "discussion_inconclusive", "description": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "reproduction_signal": {"signal_id": "signal-repo-4fa7295fba68-5512", "repository_id": "repo-4fa7295fba68", "signal_type": "discussion_inconclusive", "review_status": "candidate", "source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5512#issuecomment-4776162858", "source_title": "flax.nnx.cond causes tracing cache misses", "source_excerpt": "I''ve been looking into this and reproduced the cache misses on current main (flax 0.12.7 / jax 0.10.1) with the provided script. The cause is as described: on the graph_updates=False path, nnx.cond builds a fresh SimpleCondFn wrapper for each branch on every call, and since jax.lax.cond keys its tracing cache on callable identity (and SimpleCondFn is a `@dataclass(eq=False)`, so identity-based), e", "third_party_claim": "关键词检索候选，需人工确认是否讨论论文结果。", "third_party": null, "author_response": null, "resolution_status": "closed", "resolution_url": null, "observed_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:51.551237Z", "confidence": null, "limitations": ["未运行代码；关键词命中不能证明复现成功或失败。", "作者身份仅依据显式提供的 author_logins。"], "comments": [{"source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5512#issuecomment-4776162858", "excerpt": "I''ve been looking into this and reproduced the cache misses on current main (flax 0.12.7 / jax 0.10.1) with the provided script. The cause is as described: on the graph_updates=False path, nnx.cond builds a fresh SimpleCondFn wrapper for each branch on every call, and since jax.lax.cond keys its tracing cache on callable identity (and SimpleCondFn is a `@dataclass(eq=False)`, so identity-based), e", "login": "chenkuanliao"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5512#issuecomment-4896979049", "excerpt": "Currently reviewing @chenkuanliao''s PR, as they were the first to respond to this issue. ", "login": "samanklesaria"}, {"source_url": "https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5512#issuecomment-4897501232", "excerpt": "@samanklesaria thanks for the review and comments. I have updated the PR according to your suggestions. ", "login": "chenkuanliao"}]}, "internal_evidence": [], "external_source_urls": ["https://github.com/google/flax/issues/5512#issuecomment-4776162858"], "checked_at": "2026-10-09T04:56:51.551237Z", "uncertainty": "第三方公开线索；系统没有运行代码。关闭 issue 不等于结果已复现。"}], "alerts": [{"dimension_id": "reference_verification", "kind": "low_dimension_score", "score": 4.509803921568627}], "reference_coverage": {"expected_count": 51, "extracted_count": 51, "parsed_count": 51, "queried_count": 51, "matched_count": 5, "metadata_conflict_count": 3, "unverified_count": 30, "parse_failed_count": 0, "not_checked_count": 0, "query_failed_count": 13, "extraction_coverage": 1.0, "verification_coverage": 1.0}, "code_states": ["query_failed", "official_code_available", "no_relevant_public_feedback"], "created_at": "2026-10-09T06:14:43.884528Z", "limitations": ["试验性完整评分：无法消除的未核实、技术失败、不确定和材料缺失按可验证性较低计分，同时保留原始状态与失败原因。", "技术失败或材料缺失不等于引用虚假、结果错误、造假或其他学术不端；这些分数只表示本轮可验证性。", "本合同与实现均为独立草案，正式合同尚未取得。", "系统不运行论文代码，不提供亲自复现认证。", "外部来源只代表各记录的 checked_at/observed_at 时点。"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (case_id, credibility_assessment_id) DO NOTHING;
